  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCAP Trust Fund for Tsunami, Disaster and      Climate Preparedness 2005-2014 - Sida Follow-Up</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNESCAP Tust Fund f&#xf6;r tsunamis,  2005-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Swedish-Tahi fund established after the tsunami disaster in Dec.    2005, aiming at building regional early warning systems (buoy and     sensor systems as well local land based info systems for local        poulation). The ESCAP Trust Fund has later on broadened its scope to  promote projects that build resilience and reduce disaster risks in   Indian Ocean and Southeast Asian countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svensk-Thail&#xe4;ndsk fond etablerad efter tsunamikatastrofen dec. 2005,  i syfte att bygga upp regionalt system (bojar, sensorer samt lokala   land baserade  info system f&#xf6;r lokalbefolkning) f&#xf6;r tidig varning.    Fonden har sedan ut&#xf6;kats till att st&#xf6;dja projekt som bygger resiliens och reducerar risk i Indiska Oceanen och i l&#xe4;nder i Sydostasien.</narrative>
  </description>
